# Entitlements map for scripts/macos_sign_notarize.sh sign-tree --entitlements-map.
# One '<glob> <plist>' pair per line. <glob> matches the path relative to the
# signed tree (the .pkg payload root); <plist> is relative to this file.
# Anything not listed is signed with NO entitlements (hardened runtime only).
#
# The real player binaries live in Contents/Resources/ (the bundle's
# CFBundleExecutable is a shell launcher that execs them), base and Pro alike.
*Contents/Resources/mediaplayer_handle_vk_macos       player.entitlements
*Contents/Resources/mediaplayer_pro_handle_vk_macos   player.entitlements
